{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Advice</h1>

<p class="sub">One pass by the model across every job at once — what to apply
to first and why, what each employer is actually like to work inside, the
patterns across the set, and what you are missing. This is the read the
per-job analysis cannot give you.</p>

{% if ai_available %}
<div class="bar">
  <form method="post" action="/actions/advise">
    <input type="hidden" name="scope" value="all">
    <button type="submit" {{ 'disabled' if ai_progress.running or not job_count }}>
      Advise on all {{ job_count }}</button>
  </form>
  <form method="post" action="/actions/advise">
    <input type="hidden" name="scope" value="shortlisted">
    <button type="submit" {{ 'disabled' if ai_progress.running or not shortlist_count }}>
      Advise on the {{ shortlist_count }} shortlisted</button>
  </form>
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="sub warn">No model available. Install and log in to the
<code>claude</code> CLI (uses your Claude plan) or set
<code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code>. Everything else in the tracker works
without either.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if ai_progress.running %}
<p class="sub"><strong>Writing the briefing.</strong> One call across
{{ ai_progress.total }} job(s), so this takes under a minute. Reload to see it.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if unread_count %}
<p class="sub">{{ unread_count }} job(s) have not been read by the model yet, so
the briefing judges those on title and score alone. Run <em>Rescore all</em> on
the Job Search tab first for a sharper read.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if briefing %}
<h2>Briefing <span class="sub">{{ briefing.ts[:16].replace('T', ' ') }} UTC ·
  {{ briefing.job_count }} job(s) · {{ briefing.scope }}</span></h2>
<p class="sub">The model knows these employers from general reputation, not
from the postings — it is told to mark those claims <code>reputation:</code>.
Treat them as a starting point to check, not as fact.</p>
<pre class="advice">{{ briefing.text }}</pre>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">No briefing yet. Generate one above.</p>
{% endif %}

<style>
  pre.advice { white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.55; font: inherit;
               border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px;
               padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
</style>
{% endblock %}
